<title>UK: Oresundskonsortiet adds 200 mln DKK to Nov 05 bond.</title>
<headline>Oresundskonsortiet adds 200 mln DKK to Nov 05 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Enskilda Debt Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ORESUNDKONSORTIET</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DKK   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    15.NOV.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    COPENHAGEN</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 2OO MILLION DKK.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
